From f1987e19015dd85d698eda2c188ba1c8aefabfc5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jason Ansel <jansel@meta.com>
Date: Mon, 18 May 2026 22:48:41 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Fix bucketize lookup views in Inductor (#184043)

Realize bucketize/searchsorted lookup tensors through the extern-kernel input path and preserve layout offsets when passing boundary and sorter indices to the generated bucketize helper. Use the layout storage span for the runtime mask so sliced and zero-stride views are handled correctly.\n\nFixes #161609\nGenerated by my agent

Pull Request resolved: https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/184043
Approved by: https://github.com/AmesingFlank
---
 test/inductor/test_torchinductor.py           | 137 ++++++++++++++++++
 ...st_torchinductor_codegen_dynamic_shapes.py |   6 +
 torch/_inductor/lowering.py                   |  59 ++++----
 3 files changed, 176 insertions(+), 26 deletions(-)

